# Social Like
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Social — a many-to-many relationship: any user may like any post, at most once
# Case 11 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: social-post.menata
# Second instance of the same join/junction shape as social-follow.menata.

Like

Fields

- User : User
- Post : Post
- Liked At : Date

Events

When Like

    Post Like Count plus 1

When Unlike

    Post Like Count minus 1

Constraints

- User is required.
- Post is required.

    A User may like a given Post only once.

Permissions

Member

- Like
- Unlike

Views

- Post Likers : List
